{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：16:04 2026-09-30 HKT</p>\n\n<p>今(30日)下午近2時，旺角彌敦道687號嘉禾大廈，警方接報指一名女子倒臥平台，懷疑由高處墮下，救護員接報到場，經檢驗後證實女事主當場不治。警方正調查死者身份及其墮樓原因。</p>\n<img alt=\"消防接報到場。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5de45733fc11af05310b889346fb0523/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-30_at_14_31_20_1_.jpeg\" title=\"消防接報到場。梁國峰攝\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/063f52b87f97c8c5d2362128cc604dfe/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-30_at_14_31_20.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場為嘉禾大廈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/51f3dd9875d9a4da977ebae9892ac216/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-30_at_14_31_19_1_.jpeg\" title=\"現場為嘉禾大廈。\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T08:11:02.416714+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":3,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}